<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Develop suits resistant to high toxicity and radiation.-->
  <VAE_HazardProtection.description>开发抗高毒和抗辐射的防护服。</VAE_HazardProtection.description>
  <VAE_HazardProtection.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->environmental safeguarding-->
    <li>subject-&gt;环境保护</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->engineered suits that turn toxic wastelands into walkable lands-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;将有毒荒地变成适合步行的土地的工程服</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->developed radiation shields woven into the fabric of uniforms-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;开发了编织到制服织物中的辐射防护罩</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->created attire that allows safe research in deadly environments-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;创造了可以在致命环境中进行安全研究的服装</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->enhancing hazard resistance-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;增强抗灾能力</li>
  </VAE_HazardProtection.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: hazard protection-->
  <VAE_HazardProtection.label>危险防护</VAE_HazardProtection.label>
  <!--EN: Learn the process of tanning to craft more thicker and durable armors.-->
  <VAE_LeatherTanning.description>了解鞣制过程，以制作更厚实、更耐用的盔甲。</VAE_LeatherTanning.description>
  <VAE_LeatherTanning.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->art of leathercraft-->
    <li>subject-&gt;皮革工艺艺术</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->rediscovered ancient tanning recipes for unmatched durability-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;重新发现古老的晒​​黑配方，具有无与伦比的耐用性</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->introduced waterproofing techniques that defy harsh weathers-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;引入了抵御恶劣天气的防水技术</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->crafted armors that blend tradition with battlefield necessity-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;将传统与战场必需品融为一体的精心制作的盔甲</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->mastering leather tanning-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;掌握皮革鞣制</li>
  </VAE_LeatherTanning.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: leather tanning-->
  <VAE_LeatherTanning.label>皮革鞣制</VAE_LeatherTanning.label>
  <!--EN: Craft special military apparel allowing users to resemble the background environment such as foliage.-->
  <VAE_MlitaryCamouflage.description>制作特殊的军事服装，让用户能够模拟树叶等背景环境。</VAE_MlitaryCamouflage.description>
  <VAE_MlitaryCamouflage.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->stealth and mimicry-->
    <li>subject-&gt;隐形和模仿</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->designed gear that mimics the environment, making soldiers invisible-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;设计了模仿环境的装备，使士兵隐形</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->studied animals' camouflage to apply their patterns to military apparel-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;研究动物的伪装，将其图案应用到军事服装上</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->outfitted scouts with wear that blends seamlessly into surroundings-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;侦察兵的服装与周围环境无缝融合</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->camouflaging the forces-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;伪装部队</li>
  </VAE_MlitaryCamouflage.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: military camouflage-->
  <VAE_MlitaryCamouflage.label>军事迷彩</VAE_MlitaryCamouflage.label>
  <!--EN: Craft siegebreaker armor, heavy powered armor that significantly slows the user but provides advanced protection at range. Note that these also require advanced components.-->
  <VAE_SiegebreakerArmor.description>制作攻城盔甲，重型动力盔甲，可以显着减慢使用者的速度，但可以在一定范围内提供高级保护。请注意，这些也需要高级组件。</VAE_SiegebreakerArmor.description>
  <VAE_SiegebreakerArmor.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->fortified march-->
    <li>subject-&gt;强化行军</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->forged armor that withstands artillery, turning soldiers into walking tanks-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;锻造的装甲可以抵御火炮，将士兵变成步行坦克</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->integrated advanced tech for unmatched endurance on the battlefield-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;集成的先进技术可在战场上提供无与伦比的耐力</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->developed exoskeletons that bear the brunt, safeguarding the wearer-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;开发的外骨骼首当其冲，保护佩戴者</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->constructing siegebreaker defenses-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;构建攻城防御</li>
  </VAE_SiegebreakerArmor.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: siegebreaker armor-->
  <VAE_SiegebreakerArmor.label>攻城盔甲</VAE_SiegebreakerArmor.label>
  <!--EN: Craft trooper armor, a light semi-powered armor that is lightweight and cheap to produce. Note that these also require advanced components.-->
  <VAE_TrooperArmor.description>工艺士兵装甲，一种轻型半动力装甲，重量轻且生产成本低廉。请注意，这些也需要高级组件。</VAE_TrooperArmor.description>
  <VAE_TrooperArmor.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->agile protection-->
    <li>subject-&gt;敏捷保护</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->innovated with lightweight materials for rapid troop deployment-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;采用轻质材料进行创新，以实现快速部队部署</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->balanced protection with mobility, setting new standards for combat gear-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;平衡保护与机动性，为战斗装备设定新标准</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->pioneered the use of semi-powered armor in skirmishes-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;率先在小冲突中使用半动力装甲</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->equipping rapid response units-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;配备快速反应装置</li>
  </VAE_TrooperArmor.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: trooper armor-->
  <VAE_TrooperArmor.label>士兵装甲</VAE_TrooperArmor.label>
</LanguageData>
